name ebong
category Package
revision 55475
shortdesc Utility for writing Bengali in Rapid Roman Format
longdesc A tool (preprocessor) for writing your pRaa-ne-r ka-thaa in the
longdesc bengali langauage. It allows one to write the text in Rapid
longdesc Roman Bangla and convert it to the bangtex format by a python
longdesc program. All LaTeX markups are preserved in the target file.
